WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:02.733
Example: add travel supplies and bread; this clip uses controlled local replies

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:07.900
Inspect actual categories and products; preview pauses saving, upload and manual edits

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.433
Discard restores the project without adding history

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:16.367
Apply keeps the edits and adds one native history entry for the whole turn

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:22.033
Native history undoes/redoes the turn; applying AI edits does not publish them
